<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skin, hide,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.548
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				161
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. αἴγειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEdgar</u>
					11.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέοντος</span> a lion's <i>skin</i> for a cloak, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελαινόν,</span> of a shield,
				<i><span class="en">
				6.117
			</span></i>; of <i>skins prepared for bags, bottles,</i> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.291
			</span></i>; of <i>a man's skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.341
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.431
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				98d
			</span></i>, etc.; of <i>a man's skin</i> stripped off, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαιὸν δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					275.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῷ δ. δέδοικα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				746
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ κατὰ δέρμα θαυμαστὸς οἷος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					51(27).38
				</span></i>
			; of <i>the shell</i> of a tortoise, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				429
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1292
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>skin</i> of fruits, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικαρπίων δέρματα</span>
			<i>outer coverings</i> of seed-vessels, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.2.6
			</span></i>. <i>wallet, scrip,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
